5,1,1,talk,Asuka,,We need a system that doesn't fracture our community. I’m worried about resentment building over time.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Yumi,,"I agree, Asuka! I’ve heard people grumbling that the same spots always go to the same doors. I want to check if that’s actually true or just resentment.","{""words"":28,""mentions"":[""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,Ryuji,,The morning rush is a shoving match. Where your bike ends up determines its condition by evening. I need to see the actual flow.,"{""words"":24,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Shunichi,,"I’m curious about the actual costs. Every proposal asks what it costs the building, yet nobody checks. I want to see the ledger and the station park rates.","{""words"":28,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Toshio,,I’m concerned about the long-term maintenance burden. I want to see the supplier’s frame trial and the treasurer’s handover file.,"{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""name_label"",""name"":""Toshio"",""self"":true,""raw"":""Toshio: I’m concerned about the long-term maintenance burden. I want to see the supplier’s frame trial and the treasurer’s handover file.""}]}"
10,1,2,talk,Asuka,,"@Yumi, checking the sticker register and the complaint log will show if the grumbling is fact or just noise.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[""Yumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,1,2,talk,Yumi,,"@Asuka, that sounds perfect! I’ll check the sticker register and the five years of minutes to see if the spots really stayed the same.","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,1,2,talk,Ryuji,,"@Asuka, I’ll check the morning departures and the rain exposure. I need to see the physical reality of the congestion and damage.","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,1,2,talk,Shunichi,,"@Asuka, fair point. I’ll stick to the ledger and the station park rates. I need hard numbers, not just feelings, to see what this actually costs us.","{""words"":27,""mentions"":[""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,1,2,talk,Toshio,,"@Asuka, I’ll check the supplier’s frame trial and the treasurer’s handover file. I need to know the actual physical and administrative effort required to keep this running.","{""words"":27,""mentions"":[""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,1,3,talk,Asuka,,"@Toshio, if the maintenance burden is too high, the system collapses. I need to know if the physical effort is sustainable for one person.","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[""Toshio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,1,3,talk,Yumi,,"@Toshio, that’s a really important point! I hope the work isn’t too heavy for one person. I’m checking the minutes to see if we’ve ever reviewed this before.","{""words"":28,""mentions"":[""Toshio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,1,3,talk,Ryuji,,"@Toshio, I’m watching the physical flow. If the racks are hard to use, the morning rush gets worse. I need to see the rain damage too.","{""words"":26,""mentions"":[""Toshio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,1,3,talk,Shunichi,,"@Toshio, if the paperwork is a nightmare, the whole thing dies. I’m just here to make sure we don’t bankrupt the building trying to be nice.","{""words"":26,""mentions"":[""Toshio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,1,3,talk,Toshio,,"@Shunichi, the paperwork is the quiet killer. If it’s too heavy, it just stops. I’m checking the handover file to see the real load.","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[""Shunichi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
20,1,4,talk,Asuka,,"@Toshio, I’ll check the complaint log and the neighbouring block’s account. I need to see how these arrangements actually fail in practice.","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[""Toshio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
21,1,4,talk,Yumi,,"@Asuka, that’s a great idea! I’ll check the sticker register and the five years of minutes to see if the spots really stayed the same.","{""words"":25,""mentions"":[""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
22,1,4,talk,Ryuji,,"@Asuka, I’ll check the morning departures and the rain exposure. I need to see the physical reality of the congestion and damage.","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
23,1,4,talk,Shunichi,,"@Asuka, the neighbouring block’s failure is a useful warning. I’ll stick to the ledger and the station park rates. I need hard numbers, not just feelings, to see what this actually costs us.","{""words"":33,""mentions"":[""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
24,1,4,talk,Toshio,,"@Asuka, the complaint log shows the failure mode. I’m checking the handover file to see if the administrative load is sustainable before we commit.","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
