35,2,1,talk,Asuka,,- **Asuka**: The complaint log shows nine unresolved issues. The neighbouring block’s charge caused arrears and absenteeism. We must avoid that.,"{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
36,2,1,talk,Yumi,,"@Asuka, I found the grumbling is real! The same flats held the covered spots for five years with zero review. Plus, daily riders actually prefer paying over equal claims.","{""words"":29,""mentions"":[""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,2,1,talk,Ryuji,,"@Yumi, the data confirms the chaos. Four out of eleven mornings required shifting bikes. Plus, the exposed spots stay wet. We need a solution that fixes the flow.","{""words"":28,""mentions"":[""Yumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,2,1,talk,Shunichi,,"@Yumi, interesting. The station park charges 2,600 yen monthly, and fourteen households are waiting. Our ledger is empty for capital work. We’d need a levy to fix this properly.","{""words"":29,""mentions"":[""Yumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,2,1,talk,Toshio,,"@Shunichi, the ledger confirms capital work needs a levy. But the handover file shows three hours monthly just for current collections. Adding per-place billing would double that burden.","{""words"":28,""mentions"":[""Shunichi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
40,2,2,talk,Asuka,,"@Toshio, three hours monthly is already a burden. Adding billing risks repeating the neighbouring block’s failure. We need a system that doesn’t rely on constant enforcement.","{""words"":26,""mentions"":[""Toshio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
41,2,2,talk,Yumi,,"@Toshio, that’s a lot of work! But the minutes prove the spots were never reviewed. We need a fair system that doesn’t crash the treasurer.","{""words"":25,""mentions"":[""Toshio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
42,2,2,talk,Ryuji,,"@Toshio, three hours is manageable, but the physical strain isn’t. If the racks are hard to use, the morning rush gets worse. I need to see the rain damage too.","{""words"":30,""mentions"":[""Toshio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
43,2,2,talk,Shunichi,,"@Toshio, three hours is a lot, but the station park charges 2,600 yen. If we don’t charge, we’re subsidizing the rich. I need to see if the money covers the hassle.","{""words"":31,""mentions"":[""Toshio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
44,2,2,talk,Toshio,,"@Ryuji, the frame trial showed hoisting takes twenty seconds and both hands. That’s a daily physical toll. I’m calculating if the effort justifies the cost.","{""words"":25,""mentions"":[""Ryuji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
45,2,3,talk,Asuka,,"@Ryuji, the physical strain is real, but the social cost is higher. If the system is hard to use, people stop engaging. We need simplicity.","{""words"":25,""mentions"":[""Ryuji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
46,2,3,talk,Yumi,,"@Asuka, simplicity is key! But the minutes show the old spots were never reviewed. We need a fair system that doesn’t crash the treasurer.","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
47,2,3,talk,Ryuji,,"@Asuka, simplicity fails if the bike is wet or blocked. The rain data proves the current layout is broken. We need a physical fix, not just a social one.","{""words"":29,""mentions"":[""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
48,2,3,talk,Shunichi,,"@Ryuji, simplicity is cheap. The station park charges 2,600 yen. If we don’t charge, we’re subsidizing the rich. I need to see if the money covers the hassle.","{""words"":28,""mentions"":[""Ryuji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
49,2,3,talk,Toshio,,"@Shunichi, the ledger is empty, but the physical effort is real. Twenty seconds per bike, twice a year greasing. If we add billing, the treasurer’s three hours becomes five. That’s a quiet collapse.","{""words"":33,""mentions"":[""Shunichi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
50,2,4,talk,Asuka,,"@Toshio, you’re right. The administrative load is unsustainable. We need a solution that minimizes both physical and bureaucratic effort to prevent the system from quietly failing.","{""words"":26,""mentions"":[""Toshio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
51,2,4,talk,Yumi,,"@Asuka, I agree! We need something simple. The minutes prove the old spots were unfair, and the riders want to pay. Let’s find a fair, low-maintenance way!","{""words"":27,""mentions"":[""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
52,2,4,talk,Ryuji,,"@Asuka, simplicity ignores the wet saddles and blocked exits. The physical layout is broken. We need a fix that addresses the rain and the morning congestion, not just the paperwork.","{""words"":30,""mentions"":[""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
53,2,4,talk,Shunichi,,"@Ryuji, the rain is a nuisance, not a crisis. The ledger is empty, so any capital fix needs a levy. I’m just checking if the money is worth the headache.","{""words"":30,""mentions"":[""Ryuji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
54,2,4,talk,Toshio,,"@Ryuji, the physical layout is broken, but adding billing breaks the treasurer. I need a system that doesn’t require constant manual intervention or complex accounting.","{""words"":25,""mentions"":[""Ryuji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
